    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Appointments** and these headers in row 1: see `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings** and fill in your sheet URL, your email and names.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail on the nodes with warnings.\n4. Check the rule in **Find rows to act on** (it shows exactly which rows get an email) and the wording in **Send email**.\n5. Run it once by hand with a test row, then switch the workflow to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "769c04bd-45a1-5b6a-8a4a-de171c76ff81",
      "name": "Note: setup",
